            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "irish carfi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I am NOT a fan of seafood, and I thought this was excellent!! It did not have that \"fishy\" taste that I don't like. Used 2 cans of chopped clams and one can of baby clams. Skipped the broccoli, and sauteed several cloves of garlic with the mushrooms and red bell pepper I used linguine, but I didn't add butter, and I added the herbs and cheese to the sauce after adding the broth and cream. I used half-and-half. Easy to prepare and very filling. Highly recommended.",
