            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "luv2eat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved this as a starting point. And I’m sure worth 5 stars if made as is. I skipped the broccoli because I had none, used frozen clams in the shell, and a couple other substitutions. But the pasta was great, and cream sauce for the clams was great too. Will make again with more garlic and a loaf of fresh bread.",
